27 I have hereby given an order that throughout my royal domain everyone must tremble in fear before the God of Daniel, for this is the living God who endures forever; whose kingdom is indestructible, and whose dominion is to the end of time;
28 who delivers and saves, and performs signs and wonders in heaven and on earth, by having delivered Daniel from the power of the lions.”
29 Thus Daniel prospered during the reign of Darius and during the reign of Cyrus the Persian.
